# A creature that is itself copying something has as its copiable values what it copied together with its copy
# effect's exceptions (CR 707.9b, Clone's ruling). On turn 5 Bot1's Phyrexian Metamorph enters as a copy of Bot2's
# Guerrilla Gorilla, "except it's an artifact in addition to its other types"; then Bot1's Clone copies the Metamorph:
# the Clone is a Guerrilla Gorilla that is an artifact too (Clone has no exception of its own), while Bot2's Gorilla,
# the printed card, is a creature only. Had Clone copied the Gorilla it would not be an artifact.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Phyrexian Metamorph
Clone
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Forest
Guerrilla Gorilla
Forest x15

